WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.090
kwant is your own team of bots.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.474
On a fresh team, you start with Ann, Ben, and Cody.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:13.649
You ask once, in plain words. One bot answers, then hands the rest
on to a teammate who picks it up.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.816
You can point at the exact thing that's wrong on the page, and the
right bot gets it and fixes it.

5
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.764
Before a risky step runs, it shows you the exact command, and waits
for your approval.

6
00:00:30.827 --> 00:00:36.443
Done doesn't just mean finished. Each task shows you the checks it
passed before it's marked done.

7
00:00:37.056 --> 00:00:43.560
Set a routine once, like checking for checkout errors every morning,
and it keeps watching while you're away.

8
00:00:43.771 --> 00:00:50.955
That's kwant: your own team of bots, on Mac, Windows, Linux, or your
own server. kwant.si
